<title>USA: Dry weekend for w. African cocoa, more rain Sunday.</title>
<headline>Dry weekend for w. African cocoa, more rain Sunday.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain in west African cocoa areas will dry up over the weekend but showers and thunderstorms will return late on Sunday and early into next week, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Friday.</p>
<p>Isolated showers could hang around on Friday, left over from a recent spell of wet weather, then it will become mostly dry and warmer through Saturday.</p>
<p>Soil moisture content for the west African cocoa growing areas was favourable, WSC said.</p>
</text>
